{"title":"2010 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the largest positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> that satisfies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/0/fa07a1516924144ac9b9322e5075f1453b8ff5ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^{200} &lt; 3^{500}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"87\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/5/8552926fd522d78964f880bf84c1ca80fdee377f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 13 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 14 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 15 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 16 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"433\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/4/b248fb5c234c72db8346dda3378527af98efc6bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{bc} = (a^{b})^{c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"85\" height=\"22\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/0/fa07a1516924144ac9b9322e5075f1453b8ff5ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^{200} &lt; 3^{500}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"87\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/6/7763ce593c3a27bd646e062c4fe3aaf531f7d3e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n^{2})^{100} &lt; (3^{5})^{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"131\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>The exponents are now the same, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/0/ff0230a4a26bdb01c9da6277df16686a43f1b0e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^{2} &lt; 3^{5} = 243$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"112\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/8/03842de4932b29f36bb5bae81c6c23c58a747321.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15^2 = 225 &lt; 243$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"130\" height=\"18\" /> but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27dcdefe855d3a7f332688c25e38e69e201073d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16^2 = 256 &gt; 243$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"130\" height=\"18\" />, so the greatest positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/a/a6a719ab858b04f20ad51958e6fb53a1e8ba477a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" /> is <i>not</i> greater than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/2/0d283696fa15299ba194e896dd5a3a6c709edde1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$243$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/6/9f699fca276d7e02ebdf922093fee3c919a94cd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"66\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_2\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/CrddjOa9hhI?si=j67YJfS41NK2DfR2&amp;t=987\">https://youtu.be/CrddjOa9hhI?si=j67YJfS41NK2DfR2&amp;t=987</a> (also has problems 11-19)\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.ph